    "our_timeline_FJaEQN": {
      "type": "our-timeline",
      "name": "our-timeline",
      "settings": {
        "sub-heading": "Our Journey",
        "heading-before": "Founded in 2022 by brother and sister",
        "high-heading": "Mees & Vera van Lier",
        "heading-after": ", Lio helps people quit smoking and reclaim their health—simply, naturally, and with science on their side.",
        "content1": "<p>After months of research, Lio launched from a small apartment in Amsterdam. Mees and Vera learned quitting didn’t have to be hard, it was about the habit, not just the nicotine. They started small, packing orders themselves and listening to every bit of feedback.</p>",
        "content2": "<p>They set out to build something different. Not a product that made quitting painful, but one that made it feel possible. They listened to real stories, improved the design, and began to see hope in people’s messages.</p>",
        "content3": "<p>And today, word has spread fast. Over 80,000 people have quit smoking with Lio, often saying it was easier than they’d ever imagined. Mees and Vera keep refining, knowing every small improvement means another life changed.</p><p></p>"
      }
    },
